        "content": "| Service | URL | Default Credentials |\n|---|---|---|\n| **\ud83d\udcca Grafana** | http://localhost:3001 | `admin` / `admin` |\n| **\ud83d\udd27 Gitea** (Git) | http://localhost:3000 | `admin` / `admin123` |\n| **\ud83d\udce6 Nexus** (Artifacts) | http://localhost:8088 | `admin` / `admin123` |\n| **\ud83d\udccb Dozzle** (Logs) | http://localhost:8888 | \u2014 |\n\n```bash\n# Kubernetes\nkubectl -n sdd-dev get po -o wide\nkubectl -n sdd-dev get svc\nkubectl -n sdd-qa get po -o wide\nkubectl -n sdd-qa get svc\n```\n\n> \ud83d\udd04 Services are deployed via **Gitea Actions CI** \u2192 **kind K8s cluster**\n",
